// # Ui Media
//
// Logline: Ui, tui, gui, media, and graphics for std/media.
//
// Setup: Domain module of 34 files under std/media. Pure compute, no caps except sdl_* which take &FfiCap; ppm_write/qoi_write take &FsWriteCap at the call site.
//
// Beats:
//   1. Qoi family (2 files).
//   2. Wav family (2 files).
//   3. Audio mixer family (1 file).
//   4. Ppm family (1 file): QoiImage to P3 text sink.
//   5. Canvas family (1 file): flat-int 2D raster, QoiImage at the boundary.
//   6. Qoi file family (1 file): QOI binary sink via bytes_to_str.
//   7. Raster family (1 file): integer depth-tested triangles on Canvas.
//   8. Spin family (1 file): float degree trig plus int crossings.
//   9. Cube family (1 file): turntable mesh drawn through raster.
//   10. Sdl families (3 files): window binding, point-run blit, GL context.
//   11. Shade family (1 file): integer Lambert plus float ray-triangle.
//   12. Vector families (2 files): paths/flatten/stroke plus polygon fill.
//   13. Font family (5 files): 5x7 bitmap tables plus draw and measure.
//   14. Anim family (1 file): tweens, spin steps, RLE change sets.
//   15. Shadow family (1 file): shadow-ray cube frame.
//   16. Hdr family (1 file): float buffer, bloom, Reinhard.
//   17. Flare family (1 file): sun disk, axis ghosts, streak.
//   18. Ray family (1 file): Whitted bridge on the cube mesh.

